Z||000000||LEE498||04-26-99||09:48 PM||||<br>Do anybody now the stock valve lift of a V6 fiero?
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||04-26-99||10:50 PM||||Checked my Haynes, here it is;<p>Intake-0.231 to 0.263<br>Exhaust-0.263 to 0.273
Z||000002||Shaun41178||04-27-99||12:28 AM||||Those numbers are the lift at the cam.<p>To get the lift at the valve you have to multiply by 1.5, or whatever your stock rocker arm ratio is and with 1.5 the lift comes to .394 intake and .410 exhaust.
